NOTE_START: Template
Template plan: Semesters 1-4 follow the Registrar's advanced Biology sequence for pre-med students; Semesters 5-8 are derived from the catalog, the Pre-Medicine pathway and the 2025-26 / 2026 class lists, not from a Registrar-issued sequence.
Confirm in the term's class list: HSS-300 (no section appeared in the loaded class lists), BIO-365 (Fall only, alternate years are possible), and HSS-494 (arranged). BIO-415, BIO-435 and BIO-465 are also premed-relevant electives when scheduled.
MCAT is typically taken in spring or the summer after junior year; register with the Health Professions Advisory Committee (HPAC) in the first year and plan shadowing/clinical hours before applying. Requirements vary by medical school.
NOTE_END

